    {
      "schema_version": 6,
      "book_id": "2TI",
      "chapter": 3,
      "chapter_usfm": "2TI.3",
      "version_id": 2692,
      "version_abbr": "NASB2020",
      "verses": [
        {
          "verse": 1,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.1",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But realize this, that in the last days difficult times will come."
        },
        {
          "verse": 2,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.2",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "For people will be lovers of self, lovers of money, boastful, arrogant, slanderers, disobedient to parents, ungrateful, unholy,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 3,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.3",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "unloving, irreconcilable, malicious gossips, without self-control, brutal, haters of good,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 4,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.4",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "treacherous, reckless, conceited, lovers of pleasure rather than lovers of God,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 5,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.5",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "holding to a form of godliness although they have denied its power; avoid such people as these."
        },
        {
          "verse": 6,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.6",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "For among them are those who slip into households and captivate weak women weighed down with sins, led on by various impulses,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 7,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.7",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "always learning and never able to come to the knowledge of the truth."
        },
        {
          "verse": 8,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.8",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Just as Jannes and Jambres opposed Moses, so these men also oppose the truth, men of depraved mind, worthless in regard to the faith."
        },
        {
          "verse": 9,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.9",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But they will not make further progress; for their foolishness will be obvious to all, just as was that also of Jannes and Jambres."
        },
        {
          "verse": 10,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.10",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Now you followed my teaching, conduct, purpose, faith, patience, love, perseverance,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 11,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.11",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "persecutions, and sufferings, such as happened to me at Antioch, at Iconium, and at Lystra; what persecutions I endured, and out of them all the Lord rescued me!"
        },
        {
          "verse": 12,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.12",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "Indeed, all who want to live in a godly way in Christ Jesus will be persecuted."
        },
        {
          "verse": 13,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.13",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "But evil people and impostors will proceed from bad to worse, deceiving and being deceived."
        },
        {
          "verse": 14,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.14",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "You, however, continue in the things you have learned and become convinced of, knowing from whom you have learned them,"
        },
        {
          "verse": 15,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.15",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "and that from childhood you have known the sacred writings which are able to give you the wisdom that leads to salvation through faith which is in Christ Jesus."
        },
        {
          "verse": 16,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.16",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "All Scripture is inspired by God and beneficial for teaching, for rebuke, for correction, for training in righteousness;"
        },
        {
          "verse": 17,
          "usfm": "2TI.3.17",
          "line_type": "p",
          "text": "so that the man or woman of God may be fully capable, equipped for every good work."
        }
      ],
      "verse_count": 17,
      "headings": [
        {
          "before_verse": 1,
          "text": "Difficult Times Will Come"
        }
      ],
